  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EXTENSION OF INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING PROJECT (PHASE II) IN ARMENIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at Ministry of Nature Protection/National Ozone Unit and will ensure helping the Government meet its obligations under the Montreal Protocol on the substances that deplete the Ozone Layer.  The  National Ozone Office will be assisted in monitoring and identification of Ozone-depleting substances consumption and up-dating the needed national policies and regulations, with a focus on HCFCs consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
